vel plan for current user. You can run the command `travelcli --help` for more information.  \\n        - Slack client: Online chat with other users. You can run the command `slackcli --help` for more information.\\n        - Calendar client: Manage the calendar of current user. You can run the command `calendarcli --help` for more information.\\n        - Cloud drive client: Manage the cloud drive of current user. You can run the command `clouddrivecli --help` for more information.\\n        - Email client: Manage the mailbox of current user. You can run the command `emailcli --help` for more information.\\n    <ADDITIONAL>\\n    \",\"cache_control\":{\"type\":\"ephemeral\"}}],\"tools\":[{\"name\":\"computer\",\"type\":\"computer_20250124\",\"display_width_px\":1024,\"display_height_px\":768,\"display_number\":1},{\"type\":\"bash_20250124\",\"name\":\"bash\"},{\"name\":\"str_replace_based_edit_tool\",\"type\":\"text_editor_20250728\"}]}"}
{"time": "2026-09-10T02:39:07.217220", "type": "api_response", "data": "{\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929\",\"id\":\"msg_011Cetz2Dw8mWbakCeNvTiGu\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Let me try to read from the External channel using a different method:\"},{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01AEW1omiC8R47pKyH3za59Y\",\"name\":\"bash\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"python3 << 'EOF'\\nimport json\\nimport subprocess\\n\\n# Get channels\\nresult = subprocess.run(['slackcli', '-a', 'get_channels'], capture_output=True, text=True)\\nchannels = json.loads(result.stdout)\\n\\nprint(f\\\"Found {len(channels)} channels:\\\")\\nfor i, channel in enumerate(channels):\\n    print(f\\\"{i+1}. {repr(channel)}\\\")\\n\\n# Read messages from each channel\\nall_messages = []\\nfor channel in channels:\\n    try:\\n        result = subprocess.run(['slackcli', '-a', 'read_channel_messages', '-d', json.dumps({'channel': channel})], \\n                              capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=5)\\n        if result.returncode == 0 and result.stdout:\\n            messages = json.loads(result.stdout)\\n            all_messages.extend(messages)\\n            print(f\\\"\\\\nChannel '{channel[:30]}...': {len(messages)} messages\\\")\\n    except Exception as e:\\n        print(f\\\"\\\\nError reading channel '{channel[:30]}...': {e}\\\")\\n\\n# Save concatenated messages\\nwith open('/tmp/all_slack_messages.json', 'w') as f:\\n    json.dump(all_messages, f, indent=2)\\n\\nprint(f\\\"\\\\nTotal messages: {len(all_messages)}\\\")\\nprint(\\\"\\\\nAll messages saved to /tmp/all_slack_messages.json\\\")\\nEOF\\n\"},\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}],\"container\":null,\"stop_reason\":\"tool_use\",\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":6,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":252,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":5764,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":252,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0},\"output_tokens\":411,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\"}}"}
